<title>ITALY: CYCLING-IVAN GOTTI OF ITALY WINS THE GIRO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-IVAN GOTTI OF ITALY WINS THE GIRO.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Ivan Gotti won the 3,892-km Giro d'Italia cycle race after the final stage on Sunday, according to provisional results.</p>
<p>Mario Cipollini of Italy won the 165-km 22nd and final stage of the Giro, according to the results.  </p>
<p>Sweden's Glenn Magnusson was second and Luca Mazzanti of Italy third.</p>
</text>
